WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Action!

00:07.000 --> 00:08.000
Hi, I'm Rachel.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.000
Let's talk about Kimi's slides today.

00:11.000 --> 00:17.000
A presentable slides deck need a clear structure, cohesive design, and often several rounds of editing.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.000
Kimi's slides can take care of the entire process, from early research to the final edits.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
Give Kimi a topic and it can find relevant data, dig into the research.

00:26.000 --> 00:32.000
You can then organize everything into a clear and focused story with the polish of a top consulting firm.

00:32.000 --> 00:34.000
It helps with formatting too.

00:34.000 --> 00:43.000
Kimi can turn business data into polished charts, map project mouse-told onto a timeline, or turn complex relationships into a smart art.

00:43.000 --> 00:45.000
And nothing is locked in place.

00:45.000 --> 00:52.000
You can edit the data behind every chart, move the shape around, and adjust individual nodes and connectors in the smart art.

00:52.000 --> 00:54.000
You can set the look and feel from the start.

00:54.000 --> 01:00.000
Choose one of Kimi's templates, or upload a PowerPoint, image, or PDF as reference.

01:00.000 --> 01:05.000
Kimi will use the colors and layouts from your reference to keep the new deck consistent with your brand.

01:05.000 --> 01:09.000
Of course, the first draft is really perfect.

01:09.000 --> 01:12.000
You can keep improving it simply by talking to Kimi.

01:12.000 --> 01:16.000
Need to change a specific detail? Leave a comment directly on the slide.

01:16.000 --> 01:19.000
Kimi will jump right in and make the change.

01:19.000 --> 01:23.000
The new version history feature takes a record of every draft.

01:23.000 --> 01:26.000
If something does not work, you can simply roll it back.

01:26.000 --> 01:31.000
Kimi can also rebuild complex technical diagrams.

01:31.000 --> 01:40.000
Upload an image with PDF, and it can recognize the text, shapes, connectors, and formulas, and recreate them as elements in PowerPoint you can edit.

01:40.000 --> 01:46.000
Once you're finished, you can export your work directly to PowerPoint and keep collaborating with your team.

01:46.000 --> 01:50.000
Kimi can also create posters, infographics, and social media cards.

01:50.000 --> 01:54.000
And yes, everything is fully editable.

01:54.000 --> 01:59.000
Open Kimi's slides now, bring your ideas to life, and share them with your team.

